5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we should start by assessing the longevity of previous projects. I'll examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about the actual delivery. I will look into regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to know about the long-term costs! I'll check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I will investigate the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I'll focus on how the park is actually used and its physical limits. I'll check timed counts of weekday crossings and drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
